\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Dynamic Methanogenesis Suppression \& Soil Moisture Aeration Kinetics During AWD. A continuous 7-day (168-hour) irrigation cycle illustrates the transition across Phase 1 (standing flood, $\theta \ge 0.38\text  { m}^3/\text  {m}^3, E_h \approx -250\text  { mV}$), Phase 2 (aerobic soil drainage below $0.22\text  { m}^3/\text  {m}^3$ and $E_h > -150\text  { mV}$ halting methanogenesis), and Phase 3 (re-flooding recovery with 24-hour microbial lag phase).}}{20}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
